# doq: translated after an English change 2026-09-26
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Overview {#overview}"
msgstr "Ikhtisar {#overview}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-09-26
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "With the Constrained Quantum Optimizer by Aqarios, you can solve constrained binary optimization problems on IBM&reg; quantum hardware without manual reformulation and circuit mapping. Simply supply a problem as an LP file, an MPS file, or a [Luna Model](https://docs.aqarios.com/luna-model). The function handles reformulation, circuit synthesis, transpilation, and hardware execution automatically. The solver utilizes iterative warm-starting [\\[1\\]](#references) of the [FlexQAOA](https://docs.aqarios.com/luna-solve/algorithms/quantum-gate/flexqaoa/) algorithm, a constraint-native extension of the Quantum Approximate Optimization Algorithm (QAOA).\n"
msgstr "Dengan Constrained Quantum Optimizer oleh Aqarios, Anda dapat menyelesaikan masalah optimasi biner terbatas pada perangkat keras kuantum IBM&reg; tanpa reformulasi manual dan pemetaan sirkuit. Cukup berikan masalah sebagai file LP, file MPS, atau [Luna Model](https://docs.aqarios.com/luna-model). Fungsi ini menangani reformulasi, sintesis sirkuit, transpilasi, dan eksekusi perangkat keras secara otomatis. Solver ini memanfaatkan warm-starting iteratif [\\[1\\]](#references) dari algoritma [FlexQAOA](https://docs.aqarios.com/luna-solve/algorithms/quantum-gate/flexqaoa/), sebuah ekstensi constraint-native dari Quantum Approximate Optimization Algorithm (QAOA).\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-09-26
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The optimizer targets binary problems with constraints. In particular, one-hot constraints and set-packing constraints can be natively enforced by using XY-mixers. Other constraint types are automatically reformulated as penalty terms.\n"
msgstr "Optimizer ini menargetkan masalah biner dengan batasan (constraints). Secara khusus, batasan one-hot dan batasan set-packing dapat diterapkan secara native dengan menggunakan XY-mixer. Jenis batasan lainnya secara otomatis direformulasikan sebagai suku penalti.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-09-26
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Description {#description}"
msgstr "Deskripsi {#description}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-09-26
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"caution\" title=\"Disclaimer\">\n"
"Performance can depend on both the problem instance and subsequent processing steps. In some cases, classical samples and quantum-generated samples might achieve similar final solution quality after equivalent post-processing. Evaluation should therefore consider the complete optimization workflow.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"caution\" title=\"Penyangkalan\">\n"
"Kinerja dapat bergantung pada instance masalah maupun langkah-langkah pemrosesan selanjutnya. Dalam beberapa kasus, sampel klasik dan sampel yang dihasilkan kuantum mungkin mencapai kualitas solusi akhir yang serupa setelah pascapemrosesan yang setara. Oleh karena itu, evaluasi harus mempertimbangkan keseluruhan alur kerja optimasi.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-09-26
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The Constrained Quantum Optimizer implements the Iterative warm-start XY-mixer QAOA(IWS-QAOA) [\\[1\\]](#references). The algorithm runs fixed-angle QAOA circuits on quantum hardware and updates the initial warm-start probabilities of each circuit using measurement outcomes from the previous iteration. No variational parameter training is required; instead, a fixed linear ramp parametrization is chosen.\n"
msgstr "Constrained Quantum Optimizer mengimplementasikan Iterative warm-start XY-mixer QAOA (IWS-QAOA) [\\[1\\]](#references). Algoritma ini menjalankan sirkuit QAOA sudut tetap (fixed-angle) pada perangkat keras kuantum dan memperbarui probabilitas warm-start awal setiap sirkuit menggunakan hasil pengukuran dari iterasi sebelumnya. Tidak diperlukan pelatihan parameter variasional; sebagai gantinya, dipilih parametrisasi ramp linear tetap.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-09-26
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "By using XY-mixers to enforce one-hot constraints, you can drastically improve solution quality for constrained problems, because the search space is practically reduced to a smaller feasible subspace &mdash; and no additional complexity, due to penalty terms, is introduced in the optimization landscape.\n"
msgstr "Dengan menggunakan XY-mixer untuk menerapkan batasan one-hot, Anda dapat meningkatkan kualitas solusi secara drastis untuk masalah dengan batasan, karena ruang pencarian secara praktis direduksi menjadi subruang yang layak (feasible) yang lebih kecil &mdash; dan tidak ada kompleksitas tambahan, akibat suku penalti, yang diperkenalkan ke dalam lanskap optimasi.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-09-26
#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Workflow {#workflow}"
msgstr "Alur Kerja {#workflow}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-09-26
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The workflow of the function is described below:\n"
msgstr "Alur kerja fungsi ini dijelaskan di bawah ini:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-09-26
#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Preprocessing**: Before circuit synthesis, the optimizer analyzes the constraint structure of the input problem:\n"
msgstr "**Preprocessing**: Sebelum sintesis sirkuit, optimizer menganalisis struktur batasan dari masalah input:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-09-26
#. type: Bullet: '    - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "_Graph preprocessing:_ When applicable to the problem, it is analyzed as a graph, where edges determine the relationship between variables. This graph analysis enables two preprocessing problem enhancements. First, single constraints can be aggregated to one large constraint by using clique merging, so that they are represented by a single XY-mixer. Second, variables with only a single neighbor can be fixed deterministically, reducing the problem size and complexity.\n"
msgstr "_Preprocessing graf:_ Jika berlaku untuk masalah tersebut, masalah dianalisis sebagai graf, di mana edge menentukan hubungan antar variabel. Analisis graf ini memungkinkan dua peningkatan preprocessing masalah. Pertama, batasan tunggal dapat digabungkan menjadi satu batasan besar dengan menggunakan penggabungan clique, sehingga direpresentasikan oleh satu XY-mixer. Kedua, variabel yang hanya memiliki satu tetangga dapat difiksasi secara deterministik, sehingga mengurangi ukuran dan kompleksitas masalah.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-09-26
#. type: Bullet: '    - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "_Constraint resolution:_ The preprocessor handles each constraint separately: If the constraint is a one-hot constraint, it can be enforced through XY-mixers. If it is a set-packing constraint, it will first be transformed to a one-hot constraint. Equality constraints are handled through quadratic penalties, and inequality constraints through [unbalanced penalization](https://doi.org/10.1088/2058-9565/ad35e4).\n"
msgstr "_Penyelesaian batasan:_ Preprocessor menangani setiap batasan secara terpisah: Jika batasan tersebut adalah batasan one-hot, batasan itu dapat diterapkan melalui XY-mixer. Jika batasan tersebut adalah batasan set-packing, batasan itu akan terlebih dahulu diubah menjadi batasan one-hot. Batasan kesetaraan ditangani melalui penalti kuadratik, dan batasan ketidaksetaraan melalui [penalisasi tidak seimbang](https://doi.org/10.1088/2058-9565/ad35e4).\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-09-26
#. type: Bullet: '    - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "_Penalty derivation:_ Constraints that cannot be expressed as one-hot equality constraints are converted to penalty terms. The optimizer derives the penalty strength automatically from the problem structure.\n"
msgstr "_Penurunan penalti:_ Batasan yang tidak dapat dinyatakan sebagai batasan kesetaraan one-hot diubah menjadi suku penalti. Optimizer menentukan kekuatan penalti secara otomatis dari struktur masalah.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-09-26
#. type: Bullet: '2. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Iterative warm-starting**: The optimizer runs multiple _parallel warm-start chains_. Each chain holds a probability distribution over variable assignments, which is used as the starting probability of the QAOA circuit (warm-start state). At each iteration, a chain samples from the quantum circuit, applies classical postprocessing, and updates its distribution based on the occurrence of samples. Across iterations, this focuses the search on high-quality solutions without a variational optimization loop.\n"
msgstr "**Warm-starting iteratif**: Optimizer menjalankan beberapa _rantai warm-start paralel_. Setiap rantai menyimpan distribusi probabilitas atas penugasan variabel, yang digunakan sebagai probabilitas awal sirkuit QAOA (keadaan warm-start). Pada setiap iterasi, sebuah rantai mengambil sampel dari sirkuit kuantum, menerapkan pascapemrosesan klasik, dan memperbarui distribusinya berdasarkan kemunculan sampel. Di seluruh iterasi, ini memfokuskan pencarian pada solusi berkualitas tinggi tanpa loop optimasi variasional.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-09-26
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The number of chains (`num_parallel`), the total shot budget per chain (`total_shots`), and the number of QAOA repetitions (`reps`) are the primary controls for trading solution quality against runtime.\n"
msgstr "Jumlah rantai (`num_parallel`), total anggaran shot per rantai (`total_shots`), dan jumlah pengulangan QAOA (`reps`) adalah kontrol utama untuk menyeimbangkan kualitas solusi dengan waktu eksekusi.\n"

# doq: copied, nothing translatable
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "![Workflow diagram of the Constrained Quantum Optimizer](/docs/images/guides/aqarios-constrained-quantum-optimizer/cqo-diagram.svg)\n"
msgstr "![Workflow diagram of the Constrained Quantum Optimizer](/docs/images/guides/aqarios-constrained-quantum-optimizer/cqo-diagram.svg)\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-09-26
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Benchmarks {#benchmarks}"
msgstr "Benchmark {#benchmarks}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-09-26
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The benchmarks below show that the Constrained Quantum Optimizer Qiskit Function is capable of finding high quality, feasible solutions to constrained optimization problems with well above 100 binary variables. Accuracy is the ratio of the found objective value to the known optimum. Runtime is wall-clock time from function invocation to result delivery. QPU usage is the billable Quantum Compute time.\n"
msgstr "Benchmark di bawah ini menunjukkan bahwa Fungsi Qiskit Constrained Quantum Optimizer mampu menemukan solusi yang layak (feasible) dan berkualitas tinggi untuk masalah optimasi dengan batasan yang memiliki jauh lebih dari 100 variabel biner. Akurasi adalah rasio nilai objektif yang ditemukan terhadap optimum yang diketahui. Runtime adalah waktu wall-clock dari pemanggilan fungsi hingga pengiriman hasil. Penggunaan QPU adalah waktu Quantum Compute yang dapat ditagih.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-09-26
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Two problems were examined: The [Maximum Independent Set](/tutorials/find-the-maximum-independent-set-with-aqarios-constrained-quantum-optimizer) (MIS) problem and the Max-$k$-Cut, which is an extension of the well-known MaxCut problem to more than two categories. Max-$k$-Cut is also the optimization problem equivalent of the graph coloring decision problem (when all edges are cut, the graph is $k$-colorable).\n"
msgstr "Dua masalah diperiksa: masalah [Maximum Independent Set](/tutorials/find-the-maximum-independent-set-with-aqarios-constrained-quantum-optimizer) (MIS) dan Max-$k$-Cut, yang merupakan perluasan dari masalah MaxCut yang terkenal ke lebih dari dua kategori. Max-$k$-Cut juga merupakan padanan masalah optimasi dari masalah keputusan pewarnaan graf (graph coloring) (ketika semua edge terpotong, graf tersebut dapat diwarnai dengan $k$ warna).\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-09-26
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
